    "description": "Cross\nClassic Black Pen and Pencil Set - Gold-Tone Appointments\nVintage Professional Writing Instruments, Original Presentation Box\nThis vintage writing set from Cross features the brand's signature slim silhouette in a sophisticated matte black finish, accented by polished gold-tone hardware. As a staple of professional stationery for decades, the Cross Classic series is celebrated for its balanced weight and durable construction, representing a legacy of American craftsmanship that spans over 175 years. This particular set features a custom cross emblem on the clips, suggesting a specialized or commemorative edition.\nSet includes one twist-action ballpoint pen and one twist-action mechanical pencil\nBlack matte finish with gold-tone clips, tips, and center rings\nCustom cross emblem mounted on each clip with black and gold detailing\nOriginal hinged presentation box with cream-colored velvet-texture interior\nCondition:\nVery good vintage condition overall. The matte black barrels show minimal surface wear consistent with light use. Gold-tone appointments retain a bright finish. The mechanical pencil mechanism is functional and includes an intact eraser. Ink status is not confirmed. The presentation box shows minor exterior shelf wear, but the interior remains clean and structural.",
